# Cloudflare Pages redirects (path-based only).
#
# Old /blog/* URLs from the keyword sheet → the guides section.
/blog  /guides  301
/blog/*  /guides/:splat  301
#
# Trailing slash → no trailing slash, e.g. /merge-pdf/ → /merge-pdf (the root "/" is not affected).
/*/  /:splat  301
#
# www → apex (www.example.com → example.com) cannot be done in this file: Pages redirects match
# paths, not hostnames. Set it up in the Cloudflare dashboard with a Redirect Rule, as described in
# DEPLOY.md, step 3.
